and $R8$.


\textbf{Case $3.2.2.2$} The $2$-vertex which is adjacent to $v$ is
around one of the two $4$-faces. Then $f_4^{\frac{2}{3}}(v)\leq1$,
$n_3(v)\leq1$ as $G$ contains no configuration $H_{38}$ and by
